  "description": "The shared model behind Lockjaw: reads environment-prefixed settings from app.config and appsettings.json, resolves each key to the environment you have selected, and defines the snapshot the Lockjaw app publishes and clients read.\n\nEnvironments are open-ended — Development_ and Production_ are only the defaults, and any prefix you declare (Local_, Test_, Staging_) is picked up. Includes the editable settings catalog, overlay persistence that never rewrites your configuration files, and import/export.\n\nMost applications want Lockjaw.Client instead. Reference this package directly only when hosting the resolution yourself or building tooling on top of Lockjaw.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Lockjaw.Core",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-25T20:25:40.01Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
